      "content": "API for managing users, groups, permissions, projects, and access tokens across the JFrog Platform. JFrog Access handles identity management, role-based access control, federated identity, and scoped token creation for authentication and authorization across all JFrog services.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: JFrog",
